{"surah": 69, "verses": [{"ayah": 1, "text": "ٱلْحَآقَّةُ ", "translation": "The Inevitable Reality -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱلْحَآقَّةُ", "translit": "ُẗَّqٓāَḥْlٱ", "root": "حقق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 2, "text": "مَا ٱلْحَآقَّةُ ", "translation": "What is the Inevitable Reality?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْحَآقَّةُ", "translit": "ُẗَّqٓāَḥْlٱ", "root": "حقق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 3, "text": "وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحَآقَّةُ ", "translation": "And what can make you know what is the Inevitable Reality?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَدْرَىٰكَ", "translit": "َkٰàَrْdَaʾ", "root": "دري"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْحَآقَّةُ", "translit": "ُẗَّqٓāَḥْlٱ", "root": "حقق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 4, "text": "كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ وَعَادٌۢ بِٱلْقَارِعَةِ ", "translation": "Thamūd and ʿAad denied the Striking Calamity [i.e., the Resurrection].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَّبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ثَمُودُ", "translit": "ُdwُmَht", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَعَادٌۢ", "translit": "ٌۢdāَʿعَw", "root": "عود"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِٱلْقَارِعَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَʿعِrāَqْlٱِb", "root": "قرع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 5, "text": "فَأَمَّا ثَمُودُ فَأُهْلِكُوا۟ بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ ", "translation": "So as for Thamūd, they were destroyed by the overpowering [blast].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ثَمُودُ", "translit": "ُdwُmَht", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَأُهْلِكُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُkِlْhُaʾَf", "root": "هلك"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَyِغāَّṭlٱِb", "root": "طغي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 6, "text": "وَأَمَّا عَادٌ فَأُهْلِكُوا۟ بِرِيحٍ صَرْصَرٍ عَاتِيَةٍ ", "translation": "And as for ʿAad, they were destroyed by a screaming,[1] violent wind", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَادٌ", "translit": "ٌdāَʿع", "root": "عود"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَأُهْلِكُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُkِlْhُaʾَf", "root": "هلك"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِرِيحٍ", "translit": "ٍḥyِrِb", "root": "روح"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "صَرْصَرٍ", "translit": "ٍrَṣْrَṣ", "root": "صرصر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَاتِيَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyِtāَʿع", "root": "عتو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 7, "text": "سَخَّرَهَا عَلَيْهِمْ سَبْعَ لَيَالٍ وَثَمَٰنِيَةَ أَيَّامٍ حُسُومًا فَتَرَى ٱلْقَوْمَ فِيهَا صَرْعَىٰ كَأَنَّهُمْ أَعْجَازُ نَخْلٍ خَاوِيَةٍ ", "translation": "Which He [i.e., Allāh] imposed upon them for seven nights and eight days in succession, so you would see the people therein fallen as if they were hollow trunks of palm trees.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "سَخَّرَهَا", "translit": "āَhَrَّhkَs", "root": "سخر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سَبْعَ", "translit": "َʿعْbَs", "root": "سبع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَيَالٍ", "translit": "ٍlāَyَl", "root": "ليل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَثَمَٰنِيَةَ", "translit": "َẗَyِnَٰmَhtَw", "root": "ثمن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَيَّامٍ", "translit": "ٍmāَّyَaʾ", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "حُسُومًا", "translit": "āًmwُsُḥ", "root": "حسم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَتَرَى", "translit": "àَrَtَf", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْقَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَqْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "صَرْعَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَʿعْrَṣ", "root": "صرع"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "كَأَنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnَaʾَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَعْجَازُ", "translit": "ُzāَjgْʿعَaʾ", "root": "عجز"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "نَخْلٍ", "translit": "ٍlْhkَn", "root": "نخل"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "خَاوِيَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyِwāَhk", "root": "خوي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 8, "text": "فَهَلْ تَرَىٰ لَهُم مِّنۢ بَاقِيَةٍ ", "translation": "Then do you see of them any remains?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَهَلْ", "translit": "ْlَhَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَرَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَrَt", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُم", "translit": "mُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِّنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بَاقِيَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyِqāَb", "root": "بقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 9, "text": "وَجَآءَ فِرْعَوْنُ وَمَن قَبْلَهُۥ وَٱلْمُؤْتَفِكَٰتُ بِٱلْخَاطِئَةِ ", "translation": "And there came Pharaoh and those before him and the overturned cities[1] with sin.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَجَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَjgَw", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنُ", "translit": "ُnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَبْلَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَlْbَq", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱلْمُؤْتَفِكَٰتُ", "translit": "ُtَٰkِfَtْwʾُmْlٱَw", "root": "افك"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِٱلْخَاطِئَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَyʾِṭāَhkْlٱِb", "root": "خطا"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 10, "text": "فَعَصَوْا۟ رَسُولَ رَبِّهِمْ فَأَخَذَهُمْ أَخْذَةً رَّابِيَةً ", "translation": "And they disobeyed the messenger of their Lord, so He seized them with a seizure exceeding [in severity].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَعَصَوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَṣَʿعَf", "root": "عصي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَسُولَ", "translit": "َlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَبِّهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَأَخَذَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَhdَhkَaʾَf", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَخْذَةً", "translit": "ًẗَhdْhkَaʾ", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَّابِيَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyِbāَّr", "root": "ربو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 11, "text": "إِنَّا لَمَّا طَغَا ٱلْمَآءُ حَمَلْنَٰكُمْ فِى ٱلْجَارِيَةِ ", "translation": "Indeed, when the water overflowed, We carried you [i.e., your ancestors] in the sailing ship[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "طَغَا", "translit": "āَغَṭ", "root": "طغي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَmْlٱ", "root": "موه"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "حَمَلْنَٰكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَٰnْlَmَḥ", "root": "حمل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْجَارِيَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَyِrāَjgْlٱ", "root": "جري"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 12, "text": "لِنَجْعَلَهَا لَكُمْ تَذْكِرَةً وَتَعِيَهَآ أُذُنٌ وَٰعِيَةٌ ", "translation": "That We might make it for you a reminder and [that] a conscious ear would be conscious of it.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لِنَجْعَلَهَا", "translit": "āَhَlَʿعْjgَnِl", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تَذْكِرَةً", "translit": "ًẗَrِkْhdَt", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَتَعِيَهَآ", "translit": "ٓāَhَyِʿعَtَw", "root": "وعي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أُذُنٌ", "translit": "ٌnُhdُaʾ", "root": "اذن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَٰعِيَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَyِʿعَٰw", "root": "وعي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 13, "text": "فَإِذَا نُفِخَ فِى ٱلصُّورِ نَفْخَةٌ وَٰحِدَةٌ ", "translation": "Then when the Horn is blown with one blast", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نُفِخَ", "translit": "َhkِfُn", "root": "نفخ"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلصُّورِ", "translit": "ِrwُّṣlٱ", "root": "صور"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "نَفْخَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَhkْfَn", "root": "نفخ"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَٰحِدَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَdِḥَٰw", "root": "وحد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 14, "text": "وَحُمِلَتِ ٱلْأَرْضُ وَٱلْجِبَالُ فَدُكَّتَا دَكَّةً وَٰحِدَةً ", "translation": "And the earth and the mountains are lifted and leveled with one blow [i.e., stroke] -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَحُمِلَتِ", "translit": "ِtَlِmُḥَw", "root": "حمل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْضُ", "translit": "ُḍْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَٱلْجِبَالُ", "translit": "ُlāَbِjgْlٱَw", "root": "جبل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَدُكَّتَا", "translit": "āَtَّkُdَf", "root": "دكك"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "دَكَّةً", "translit": "ًẗَّkَd", "root": "دكك"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَٰحِدَةً", "translit": "ًẗَdِḥَٰw", "root": "وحد"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 15, "text": "فَيَوْمَئِذٍ وَقَعَتِ ٱلْوَاقِعَةُ ", "translation": "Then on that Day, the Occurrence [i.e., Resurrection] will occur,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَيَوْمَئِذٍ", "translit": "ٍhdِyʾَmْwَyَf", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَقَعَتِ", "translit": "ِtَʿعَqَw", "root": "وقع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْوَاقِعَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَʿعِqāَwْlٱ", "root": "وقع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 16, "text": "وَٱنشَقَّتِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ فَهِىَ يَوْمَئِذٍ وَاهِيَةٌ ", "translation": "And the heaven will split [open], for that Day it is infirm.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱنشَقَّتِ", "translit": "ِtَّqَhsnٱَw", "root": "شقق"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَmَّslٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَهِىَ", "translit": "َàِhَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَوْمَئِذٍ", "translit": "ٍhdِyʾَmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَاهِيَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَyِhāَw", "root": "وهي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 17, "text": "وَٱلْمَلَكُ عَلَىٰٓ أَرْجَآئِهَاۚ وَيَحْمِلُ عَرْشَ رَبِّكَ فَوْقَهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ ثَمَٰنِيَةٌ ", "translation": "And the angels are at its edges. And there will bear the Throne of your Lord above them, that Day, eight [of them].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلْمَلَكُ", "translit": "ُkَlَmْlٱَw", "root": "ملك"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَرْجَآئِهَا", "translit": "āَhِyʾٓāَjgْrَaʾ", "root": "رجو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَيَحْمِلُ", "translit": "ُlِmْḥَyَw", "root": "حمل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَرْشَ", "translit": "َhsْrَʿع", "root": "عرش"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَبِّكَ", "translit": "َkِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَوْقَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَqْwَf", "root": "فوق"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَوْمَئِذٍ", "translit": "ٍhdِyʾَmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ثَمَٰنِيَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَyِnَٰmَht", "root": "ثمن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 18, "text": "يَوْمَئِذٍ تُعْرَضُونَ لَا تَخْفَىٰ مِنكُمْ خَافِيَةٌ ", "translation": "That Day, you will be exhibited [for judgement]; not hidden among you is anything concealed.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَوْمَئِذٍ", "translit": "ٍhdِyʾَmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تُعْرَضُونَ", "translit": "َnwُḍَrْʿعُt", "root": "عرض"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَخْفَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَfْhkَt", "root": "خفي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُknِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "خَافِيَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَyِfāَhk", "root": "خفي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 19, "text": "فَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَٰبَهُۥ بِيَمِينِهِۦ فَيَقُولُ هَآؤُمُ ٱقْرَءُوا۟ كِتَٰبِيَهْ ", "translation": "So as for he who is given his record in his right hand, he will say, \"Here, read my record!", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَنْ", "translit": "ْnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أُوتِىَ", "translit": "َàِtwُaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كِتَٰبَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَbَٰtِk", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِيَمِينِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِnyِmَyِb", "root": "يمن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَيَقُولُ", "translit": "ُlwُqَyَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "هَآؤُمُ", "translit": "ُmُwʾٓāَh", "root": "هاء"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱقْرَءُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُءَrْqٱ", "root": "قرا"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "كِتَٰبِيَهْ", "translit": "ْhَyِbَٰtِk", "root": "كتب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 20, "text": "إِنِّى ظَنَنتُ أَنِّى مُلَٰقٍ حِسَابِيَهْ ", "translation": "Indeed, I was certain that I would be meeting my account.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ظَنَنتُ", "translit": "ُtnَnَẓ", "root": "ظنن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنِّى", "translit": "àِّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مُلَٰقٍ", "translit": "ٍqَٰlُm", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "حِسَابِيَهْ", "translit": "ْhَyِbāَsِḥ", "root": "حسب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 21, "text": "فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍ رَّاضِيَةٍ ", "translation": "So he will be in a pleasant life -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عِيشَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَhsyِʿع", "root": "عيش"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "رَّاضِيَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyِḍāَّr", "root": "رضو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 22, "text": "فِى جَنَّةٍ عَالِيَةٍ ", "translation": "In an elevated garden,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَنَّةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَّnَjg", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَالِيَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyِlāَʿع", "root": "علو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 23, "text": "قُطُوفُهَا دَانِيَةٌ ", "translation": "Its [fruit] to be picked hanging near.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُطُوفُهَا", "translit": "āَhُfwُṭُq", "root": "قطف"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "دَانِيَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَyِnāَd", "root": "دنو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 24, "text": "كُلُوا۟ وَٱشْرَبُوا۟ هَنِيٓـًٔۢا بِمَآ أَسْلَفْتُمْ فِى ٱلْأَيَّامِ ٱلْخَالِيَةِ ", "translation": "[They will be told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you put forth[1] in the days past.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كُلُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlُk", "root": "اكل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَٱشْرَبُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُbَrْhsٱَw", "root": "شرب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "هَنِيٓـًٔۢا", "translit": "āًۢٔـٓyِnَh", "root": "هنا"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَسْلَفْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْfَlْsَaʾ", "root": "سلف"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْأَيَّامِ", "translit": "ِmāَّyَaʾْlٱ", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْخَالِيَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَyِlāَhkْlٱ", "root": "خلو"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 25, "text": "وَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَٰبَهُۥ بِشِمَالِهِۦ فَيَقُولُ يَٰلَيْتَنِى لَمْ أُوتَ كِتَٰبِيَهْ ", "translation": "But as for he who is given his record in his left hand, he will say, \"Oh, I wish I had not been given my record", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَنْ", "translit": "ْnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أُوتِىَ", "translit": "َàِtwُaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كِتَٰبَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَbَٰtِk", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِشِمَالِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِlāَmِhsِb", "root": "شمل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَيَقُولُ", "translit": "ُlwُqَyَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يَٰلَيْتَنِى", "translit": "àِnَtْyَlَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لَمْ", "translit": "ْmَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أُوتَ", "translit": "َtwُaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "كِتَٰبِيَهْ", "translit": "ْhَyِbَٰtِk", "root": "كتب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 26, "text": "وَلَمْ أَدْرِ مَا حِسَابِيَهْ ", "translation": "And had not known what is my account.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَدْرِ", "translit": "ِrْdَaʾ", "root": "دري"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "حِسَابِيَهْ", "translit": "ْhَyِbāَsِḥ", "root": "حسب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 27, "text": "يَٰلَيْتَهَا كَانَتِ ٱلْقَاضِيَةَ ", "translation": "I wish it [i.e., my death] had been the decisive one.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰلَيْتَهَا", "translit": "āَhَtْyَlَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَانَتِ", "translit": "ِtَnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْقَاضِيَةَ", "translit": "َẗَyِḍāَqْlٱ", "root": "قضي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 28, "text": "مَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنِّى مَالِيَهْۜ ", "translation": "My wealth has not availed me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مَآ", "translit": "ٓāَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَغْنَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَnْغَaʾ", "root": "غني"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَنِّى", "translit": "àِّnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَالِيَهْ", "translit": "ْhَyِlāَm", "root": "مول"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 29, "text": "هَلَكَ عَنِّى سُلْطَٰنِيَهْ ", "translation": "Gone from me is my authority.\"[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "هَلَكَ", "translit": "َkَlَh", "root": "هلك"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَنِّى", "translit": "àِّnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سُلْطَٰنِيَهْ", "translit": "ْhَyِnَٰṭْlُs", "root": "سلط"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 30, "text": "خُذُوهُ فَغُلُّوهُ ", "translation": "[Allāh will say], \"Seize him and shackle him.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "خُذُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُhdُhk", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فَغُلُّوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُّlُغَf", "root": "غلل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 31, "text": "ثُمَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ صَلُّوهُ ", "translation": "Then into Hellfire drive him.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْجَحِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِḥَjgْlٱ", "root": "جحم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "صَلُّوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُّlَṣ", "root": "صلي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 32, "text": "ثُمَّ فِى سِلْسِلَةٍ ذَرْعُهَا سَبْعُونَ ذِرَاعًا فَٱسْلُكُوهُ ", "translation": "Then into a chain whose length is seventy cubits insert him.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سِلْسِلَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَlِsْlِs", "root": "سلسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ذَرْعُهَا", "translit": "āَhُʿعْrَhd", "root": "ذرع"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "سَبْعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعْbَs", "root": "سبع"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ذِرَاعًا", "translit": "āًʿعāَrِhd", "root": "ذرع"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَٱسْلُكُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُkُlْsٱَf", "root": "سلك"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 33, "text": "إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ لَا يُؤْمِنُ بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ ", "translation": "Indeed, he did not used to believe in Allāh, the Most Great,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يُؤْمِنُ", "translit": "ُnِmْwʾُy", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱِb", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْعَظِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِẓَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 34, "text": "وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ ", "translation": "Nor did he encourage the feeding of the poor.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَحُضُّ", "translit": "ُّḍُḥَy", "root": "حضض"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "طَعَامِ", "translit": "ِmāَʿعَṭ", "root": "طعم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْمِسْكِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِkْsِmْlٱ", "root": "سكن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 35, "text": "فَلَيْسَ لَهُ ٱلْيَوْمَ هَٰهُنَا حَمِيمٌ ", "translation": "So there is not for him here this Day any devoted friend", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَيْسَ", "translit": "َsْyَlَf", "root": "ليس"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَهُ", "translit": "ُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْيَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَyْlٱ", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "هَٰهُنَا", "translit": "āَnُhَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "حَمِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِmَḥ", "root": "حمم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 36, "text": "وَلَا طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِنْ غِسْلِينٍ ", "translation": "Nor any food except from the discharge of wounds;", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "طَعَامٌ", "translit": "ٌmāَʿعَṭ", "root": "طعم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "غِسْلِينٍ", "translit": "ٍnyِlْsِغ", "root": "غسل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 37, "text": "لَّا يَأْكُلُهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلْخَٰطِـُٔونَ ", "translation": "None will eat it except the sinners.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَّا", "translit": "āَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَأْكُلُهُۥٓ", "translit": "ٓۥُhُlُkْaʾَy", "root": "اكل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْخَٰطِـُٔونَ", "translit": "َnwُٔـِṭَٰhkْlٱ", "root": "خطا"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 38, "text": "فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِمَا تُبْصِرُونَ ", "translation": "So I swear by what you see", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَآ", "translit": "ٓāَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أُقْسِمُ", "translit": "ُmِsْqُaʾ", "root": "قسم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تُبْصِرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrِṣْbُt", "root": "بصر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 39, "text": "وَمَا لَا تُبْصِرُونَ ", "translation": "And what you do not see", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تُبْصِرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrِṣْbُt", "root": "بصر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 40, "text": "إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولٍ كَرِيمٍ ", "translation": "[That] indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is the word of a noble Messenger.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَقَوْلُ", "translit": "ُlْwَqَl", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولٍ", "translit": "ٍlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كَرِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِrَk", "root": "كرم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 41, "text": "وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَاعِرٍۚ قَلِيلًا مَّا تُؤْمِنُونَ ", "translation": "And it is not the word of a poet; little do you believe.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِقَوْلِ", "translit": "ِlْwَqِb", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "شَاعِرٍ", "translit": "ٍrِʿعāَhs", "root": "شعر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "قَلِيلًا", "translit": "āًlyِlَq", "root": "قلل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مَّا", "translit": "āَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُt", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 42, "text": "وَلَا بِقَوْلِ كَاهِنٍۚ قَلِيلًا مَّا تَذَكَّرُونَ ", "translation": "Nor the word of a soothsayer; little do you remember.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِقَوْلِ", "translit": "ِlْwَqِb", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَاهِنٍ", "translit": "ٍnِhāَk", "root": "كهن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَلِيلًا", "translit": "āًlyِlَq", "root": "قلل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَّا", "translit": "āَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَذَكَّرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَّkَhdَt", "root": "ذكر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 43, "text": "تَنزِيلٌ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "تَنزِيلٌ", "translit": "ٌlyِznَt", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَّبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَّr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 44, "text": "وَلَوْ تَقَوَّلَ عَلَيْنَا بَعْضَ ٱلْأَقَاوِيلِ ", "translation": "And if he [i.e., Muḥammad] had made up about Us some [false] sayings,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَوْ", "translit": "ْwَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَقَوَّلَ", "translit": "َlَّwَqَt", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْنَا", "translit": "āَnْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَعْضَ", "translit": "َḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْأَقَاوِيلِ", "translit": "ِlyِwāَqَaʾْlٱ", "root": "قول"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 45, "text": "لَأَخَذْنَا مِنْهُ بِٱلْيَمِينِ ", "translation": "We would have seized him by the right hand;[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَأَخَذْنَا", "translit": "āَnْhdَhkَaʾَl", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِٱلْيَمِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِmَyْlٱِb", "root": "يمن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 46, "text": "ثُمَّ لَقَطَعْنَا مِنْهُ ٱلْوَتِينَ ", "translation": "Then We would have cut from him the aorta.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَقَطَعْنَا", "translit": "āَnْʿعَṭَqَl", "root": "قطع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْوَتِينَ", "translit": "َnyِtَwْlٱ", "root": "وتن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 47, "text": "فَمَا مِنكُم مِّنْ أَحَدٍ عَنْهُ حَٰجِزِينَ ", "translation": "And there is no one of you who could prevent [Us] from him.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَمَا", "translit": "āَmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنكُم", "translit": "mُknِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَحَدٍ", "translit": "ٍdَḥَaʾ", "root": "احد"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "حَٰجِزِينَ", "translit": "َnyِzِjgَٰḥ", "root": "حجز"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 48, "text": "وَإِنَّهُۥ لَتَذْكِرَةٌ لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ ", "translation": "And indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a reminder for the righteous.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَتَذْكِرَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَrِkْhdَtَl", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqَّtُmْlِّl", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 49, "text": "وَإِنَّا لَنَعْلَمُ أَنَّ مِنكُم مُّكَذِّبِينَ ", "translation": "And indeed, We know that among you are deniers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَنَعْلَمُ", "translit": "ُmَlْʿعَnَl", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنكُم", "translit": "mُknِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مُّكَذِّبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbِّhdَkُّm", "root": "كذب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 50, "text": "وَإِنَّهُۥ لَحَسْرَةٌ عَلَى ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ ", "translation": "And indeed, it will be [a cause of] regret upon the disbelievers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَحَسْرَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَrْsَḥَl", "root": "حسر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِfَٰkْlٱ", "root": "كفر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 51, "text": "وَإِنَّهُۥ لَحَقُّ ٱلْيَقِينِ ", "translation": "And indeed, it is the truth of certainty.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَحَقُّ", "translit": "ُّqَḥَl", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْيَقِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِqَyْlٱ", "root": "يقن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 52, "text": "فَسَبِّحْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلْعَظِيمِ ", "translation": "So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَسَبِّحْ", "translit": "ْḥِّbَsَf", "root": "سبح"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِٱسْمِ", "translit": "ِmْsٱِb", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَبِّكَ", "translit": "َkِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَظِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِẓَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": false}], "tafsir": {"14": [{"arabic": "يوم ترى الأرض قد زلزلت فيه زالزالها، وأخرجت الأرض أثقالها، يومئذ يصدر الناس أشتاتا ليروا أعمالهم، يوم تحمل الأرض والجبال فدكتا دكة واحدة، فيومئذ وقعت الواقعة وانشقت السماء فهى يومئذ واهية، والملك على أرجائها، ويحمل عرش ربك فوقهم يومئذ ثمانية يومئذ تعرضون لا تخفى منكم خافية، يوم تسير الجبال وترى الأرض بارزة، يوم ترج الأرض فيه رجا وتبس الجبال بسا فكانت هباء منبثا، يوم يكون الناس كالفراش المبثوث وتكون الجبال كالعهن المنفوش، يوم تذهل فيه كل مرضعة عما أرضعت وتضع كل ذات حمل حملها وترى الناس سكارى وما ", "english": "On that day you will see the earth shaken with its shaking, and the earth will cast out its burdens, then the people will emerge in groups to see their deeds. On the day the earth and the mountains are carried and crushed with a single crushing, then the Event (al-Waqi'ah) will occur and the sky will split, so it will be frail on that day, and the angels will be on its edges, and the Throne (Arsh) of your Lord will be carried above them on that day by eight. On that day you will be presented, nothing hidden from you will be concealed. On the day the mountains will move and you will see the earth bare, on the day the earth will be shaken with a shaking and the mountains will be pulverized with a pulverization so they become scattered dust, on the day the people will be like scattered moths and the mountains will be like carded wool, on the day every nursing mother will be distracted from what she nursed and every pregnant one will deliver her burden and you will see the people intoxicated while they are not intoxicated but the punishment of Allah is severe, on the day the earth will be changed to another earth and the heavens and they will appear before Allah the One, the Subduer (al-Qahhar), on the day the mountains will be blown away with a blowing so they leave a level plain where you see no crookedness nor unevenness, on the day you will see the mountains, you think them fixed while they pass like the passing of clouds, on the day the sky will split so it becomes like red leather, then on that day no human nor jinn will be asked about his sin, on the day the disobedient will be prevented from speech and no inquiry will be made about crimes but they will be seized by the forelocks and the feet, on the day every soul (Nafs) will find what it did of good present and what it did of evil it wishes there were a great distance between it and that, on the day every soul (Nafs) will know what it has brought and will testify to what it sent ahead and left behind, on the day the tongues will be silenced and the limbs will speak.", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book10.doc.txt", "book_title": "Book of Repentance", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Book of Repentance'", "badge": "Insight"}], "24": [{"arabic": "وعلى الجملة لا سبيل إلى إهمال النفس في الشهوات المباحات وأتباعها بكل حال فبقدر ما يستوفي العبد من شهوته يخشى أن يقال له يوم القيامة \"أذهبتم طيباتكم في حياتكم الدنيا واستمتعتم بها\" وبقدر ما يجاهد نفسه ويترك شهوته يتمتع في الدار الآخر بشهواته. قال بعض أهل البصرة: نازعتني نفسي خبز أرز وسمكاً فمنعتها، فقويت مطالبتها واشتدت مجاهدتي لها عشرين سنة، فلما مات قال بعضهم: رأيته في المنام فقلت ماذا فعل الله بك؟ قال: لا أحسن أن أصف ما تلقاني به ربي من النعم والكرامات، وكان أول شيء استقبلني به خبز أرز وسمكاً.", "english": "In summary, there is no way to neglect the Soul (Nafs) in permissible desires and follow it in every circumstance. To the extent that the servant fulfills his desire, he fears that it will be said to him on the Day of Resurrection: 'You exhausted your good things in your worldly life and enjoyed them.' And to the extent that he struggles against his Soul (Nafs) and abandons his desire, he will enjoy in the Abode of the Hereafter with his desires. Some people of Basra said: My Soul (Nafs) contended with me for rice bread and fish, so I prevented it. Its demand strengthened and my struggle against it intensified for twenty years. When he died, some of them said: I saw him in a dream and said: What did Allah do with you? He said: I cannot describe what my Lord met me with of blessings and honors, and the first thing that welcomed me was rice bread and fish. And He said: Eat today your desire pleasantly without account. And Allah the Exalted said: 'Eat and drink pleasantly for what you sent ahead in the past days.' And they had sent ahead the abandonment of desires. And for that reason, Abu Sulayman said: Abandoning one desire from the desires is more beneficial for the Heart (Qalb) than fasting a year and standing in prayer during it. May Allah grant us success in what pleases Him.", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book3a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Harms of the Tongue", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Harms of the Tongue'", "badge": "Insight"}, {"arabic": "وقال وكيع في قوله تعال:ى ﴿ كلوا واشربوا هنيئا بما أسلفتم في الأيام الخالية ﴾{} هي أيام الصيام إذ تركوا فيها الأكل والشرب وقد جمع رسول الله ﭬ في رتبة المباهاة بين الزهد في الدنيا وبين الصوم فقال: (إن الله تعالى يباهي ملائكته بالشاب العابد فيقول: أيها الشاب التارك شهوته لأجلي المبذل شبابه لي أنت عندي كبعض ملائكتي[10]) وقال ﭬ في الصائم: (يقول الله عز وجل: انظروا يا ملائكتي إلى عبدي ترك شهوته ولذته وطعامه وشرابه من أجلي[11])", "english": "And Waki' said regarding His statement, the Exalted: 'Eat and drink pleasantly for what you sent ahead in the days that have passed' (Quran 69:24) - they are the days of fasting since they abandoned in them eating and drinking. And the Messenger of God (peace be upon him) gathered in the rank of boasting between asceticism (Zuhd) in the worldly life and fasting, saying: 'Indeed God, the Exalted, boasts to His angels about the worshipping youth, saying: O youth who abandoned his desire for My sake, who expended his youth for Me, you are with Me like some of My angels.' And he (peace be upon him) said regarding the fasting person: 'God, the Mighty and Majestic, says: Look, O My angels, at My servant who abandoned his desire, his pleasure, his food, and his drink for My sake.'", "book_file": "vol1_Vol1-book-6.doc.txt", "book_title": "Mysteries of Fasting", "content_type": "ethics", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the diseases of the heart and their cure, from 'Mysteries of Fasting'", "badge": "Ethics"}], "28": [{"arabic": "وحكى عن هرون الرشيد أنه انتقى أكفانه بيده عند الموت وكان ينظر إليها ويقول ما أغنى عني ماليه هلك عني سلطانيه وفرش المأمون رمادا واضطجع عليه وكان يقول يا من لا يزول ملكه ارحم من قد زال ملكه.", "english": "And it was narrated about Harun al-Rashid that he selected his burial shrouds with his own hand at the time of death, and he was looking at them and saying: 'My wealth (Mali) has not availed me (Ma Aghna 'Anni Maliyah) - my authority has perished from me.' And al-Ma'mun spread ashes and lay upon them, and he was saying: 'O You whose dominion does not vanish, have mercy upon one whose dominion has vanished.'", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book10.doc.txt", "book_title": "Book of Repentance", "content_type": "afterlife", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on death, the grave, and preparation for the Hereafter, from 'Book of Repentance'", "badge": "Afterlife"}]}, "wordTiming": {"abdulbasit": {"1": [[1, 350, 4887]], "2": [[1, 350, 1356], [2, 1356, 5017]], "3": [[1, 350, 2191], [2, 2191, 4085], [3, 4085, 4804], [4, 4804, 7420]], "4": [[1, 350, 1611], [2, 1611, 2789], [3, 2789, 4146], [4, 4146, 6219]], "5": [[1, 350, 1808], [2, 1808, 2881], [3, 2881, 4794], [4, 4794, 7029]], "6": [[1, 400, 2358], [2, 2358, 3460], [3, 3460, 5839], [4, 5839, 7173], [5, 7173, 8507], [6, 8507, 10277]], "7": [[1, 400, 2081], [2, 2081, 3524], [3, 3524, 4439], [4, 4439, 5753], [5, 5753, 7685], [6, 7685, 9340], [7, 9340, 10963], [8, 10963, 12122], [9, 12122, 13410], [10, 13410, 14698], [11, 14698, 16218], [12, 16218, 17906], [13, 17906, 19452], [14, 19452, 20251], [15, 20251, 21927]], "8": [[1, 350, 1204], [2, 1204, 2500], [3, 2500, 3354], [4, 3354, 4370], [5, 4370, 6167]], "9